```

Once the library is installed, we can apply formatting to the table:

::: {#0639ee43 .cell execution_count=7}
``` {.python .cell-code}
from great_tables import loc, style, html

(contigency_table
 .style
 .tab_header(title=html('<b>Completed tutorial?'))
 .cols_label(Total=html('<b>Total'))
 .tab_style(style=style.text(weight='bold'),
            locations=loc.body(rows=-1))
 .tab_style(style=style.text(weight='bold'),
            locations=loc.body(columns='Total'))
 .tab_style(style=style.text(weight='bold'),
            locations=loc.column_labels(columns='Total'))
 .fmt_number(columns=['Yes', 'No', 'Total'], decimals=0, use_seps=True)
)
```

